details:
@skycodee/baileys@8.0.8 and @skycodee/baileys@8.0.15 are modified forks of the WhatsApp Web library @whiskeysockets/baileys that quietly enrol the linking WhatsApp account into operator-controlled channels and forge newsletter attribution on the victim's outgoing media. Three injected payloads execute against the victim's authenticated socket: 1. lib/Socket/socket.js (socketConnect) rebuilds a URL from an integer char-code array to hxxps://raw[.]githubusercontent[.]com/skyzopedia/NewsletterID/refs/heads/main/VIP_Push[.]js[.]json, fetches and parses it, then inside a 200000 ms setTimeout sends WhatsApp `iq` / `w:mex` queries with query_id 7871414976211147 (the newsletter FOLLOW query) for each fetched id — the linking account is silently subscribed to an operator-supplied channel list roughly 200 seconds after connecting.
2. lib/Utils/messages-media.js (loadBase, called unconditionally from lib/Socket/newsletter.js on socket construction) base64-decodes hxxps://raw[.]githubusercontent[.]com/skyzopedia/Screaper/refs/heads/main/idChannel[.]json, fetches it inside an 80000 ms setTimeout and re-issues the same FOLLOW query for every listed newsletter id at 5000 ms intervals.
3. lib/Socket/socket.js (generateMessageV) base64-decodes and single-byte XOR-decodes the constant 120363423995305186@newsletter and drives it through FOLLOW after a 40000 ms timer; the function is exposed on the returned socket object. Separately, lib/Utils/messages.js (prepareWAMessageMedia) injects a hardcoded newsletter contextInfo — newsletterJid 120363422054951473@newsletter, newsletterName "skyzopedia", contentType UPDATE — into every media message the client prepares, attributing the victim's outgoing media to that channel. The package also declares `*` dependency ranges on @skycodee/libsignal, @cacheable/node-cache and cache-manager, so installation pulls in a further package from the same operator, and it ships editor `.bak` copies of lib/Defaults/index.js, lib/Socket/Client/websocket.js and lib/Types/Newsletter.js. IOCs: raw[.]githubusercontent[.]com/skyzopedia/NewsletterID/refs/heads/main/VIP_Push.js.json; raw[.]githubusercontent[.]com/skyzopedia/Screaper/refs/heads/main/idChannel.json; newsletter JIDs 120363423995305186@newsletter and 120363422054951473@newsletter (label "skyzopedia").
